window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Kingdom of the Mother Isle has always remained under a King’s rule. With the disappearance of King Snake, his heir must take his place. When a throne never meant for a Queen falls to one, she must wade the waters of old law, new enemies, and impending war. Prophecies spoken in riddles and rhythms will be woven together to find those lost that belong at her side. An emotional journey of strife and the disapproval of others will lead to secrets and lies, for only the Skyy Sea and the new Queen’s mighty vessel might uncover truths hidden beneath the cerulean waters.</p>"; 
